==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 2~6.67 seconds<sup>60f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 2.67~13.33 seconds<sup>80f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 3.33~20 seconds<sup>100f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Swordsman (form 2) (Enemy)|Swordsmen (form 2)]] spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 3.33~20 seconds<sup>100f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Princess Head]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Swordsman (form 2) (Enemy)|Swordsmen (form 2)]] spawn, delay 2~10 seconds<sup>60f~300f</sup>.
**10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.13 seconds<sup>2f~4f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.07~6.67 seconds<sup>2f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win. Treat Princess Head as a slightly stronger [[Shy Boy]] without a red trait.

